<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">6.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><B><I>Reporting changes in ICFR:</I></B> The issuer has disclosed in its interim MD&amp;A any change in
the issuer&rsquo;s ICFR that occurred during the period beginning on April 1, 2026 and ended on June 30, 2026 that has materially affected,
or is reasonably likely to materially affect, the issuer&rsquo;s ICFR.</TD></TR></TABLE>

